	Under all the Assumptions in Theorem~\ref{thm:main} and Assumption~\ref{ass:reg.condreg}, the main result in Theorem ~\ref{thm:main} hold when $\bs{Y}:=\bs{Y}^*-X\bs{\gamma}$ is replaced by $\bs{Y}:= \bs{Y}^*-X\tilde{\bs{\gamma}}$ in all definitions.
