	\lVert L  L^\dagger \mathcal{R}^\prime \rVert 
	\leq_{(2)} 
	M \cdot \lVert L  L^\dagger \rVert 
	\leq_{(3)} 
	M 
	$,
	where $=_{(1)}$ follows from $B\mathcal{R}=B$, $=_{(2)}$ follows from $||\mathcal{R}||\le M$, and $=_{(3)}$ holds because $L  L^\dagger$ is a projection matrix.
