    Let $(M,\omega)$ be a monotone symplectic manifold with minimal Chern number $N$ determined by $c_1(\pi_2(M))=N\cdot \Z$. Suppose that $a\in H_{k}(M;\C)$ ($0\leq k<2n$) is a $0$-nonnilpotent element in $QH_*(M,\zeta)_0$. Then, for all $\varphi\in\ham(M,\omega)$, 
