The multiple-gain model estimates the average-case upper bounds of EFHT by Formula (4). Before deriving the average-case upper bound of EFHT, it is necessary to select the parameter $k$ for expected multiple-gain, where the range of $k$ depends on the estimation of $k_{low}$ obtained from experiments. 

