\caption{Column densities (first row) and structure factors (second row) for $\omega_y/(2\pi)=20$ (a), $60$ (b), $80$ (c), $100$ (d), and $180\,{\rm Hz}$ (e). (f) shows the peak-to-peak coherence versus $\omega_y$ in the SS phase.}
