(b)-(c): Adiabatic and effective potentials for \(\xi = 0^{\circ}\) (blue), \(3^{\circ}\) (red), and \(6^{\circ}\) (black). Solid curves represent the adiabatic potentials, while dashed curves show the corresponding effective potentials. (b) Potentials along the \(y\)-direction. (c) Potentials along the \(x\)-direction.
