    \caption{(a) and (b) show numerically simulated temporal and spectral intensity profiles obtained via numerical split-step integration of~\eqref{LLE} for different values of the cavity detuning [with the same cavity and pump parameters as in Fig.~\ref{fig1}]. (c) Newton-Raphson continuation using the same parameters as in (a) and (b). The shaded blue (orange) region shows where single (bound) CSs are the only states available, and thus will be self-excited. The black, blue, orange, and green solid curves represent the HSS, single CS, and double- and triple-bound CS states, respectively, with the dotted curves showing the unstable states.}
