 \end{center}
\caption{ 
Density (top) and velocity (bottom) structure of the ultra-stripped SN model shortly before the shock breakout (2,072~sec after core collapse) as obtained by \citet{muller2018}.  This structure is the initial condition for the light-curve model without CSM.
