		\noindent To establish a correspondence of a system involving $M+N$ acting on a \blue{direct} product of state, adjoint and auxiliary variables and the optimality system \eqref{eq:optcond2}, we will utilize the concatenation operator $\mathcal{C}\in \mathcal L(\Z,\LL^2([0,T];\X)^2)$ defined by
		\begin{small}
			\begin{align}
