\section{Introduction}

The \ac{3GPP} recently standardized \ac{IVAS}~\cite{3GPP250,3GPP253,Multrus2024IVAS} with the aim of providing an immersive experience for several communication scenarios. It extends the \ac{3GPP} \ac{EVS} mono codec~\cite{3GPP445,Dietz2015} towards a multitude of audio formats such as stereo, multi-channel audio, scene-based audio (Ambisonics), and object-based audio.

