%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%
\section{Direct numerical simulation of wind-forced breaking waves}\label{sec:dns_wfb}
%
In this section, we briefly summarize the computational setup in \S\ref{sec:frame} already discussed in~\cite{scapin2025mom}, and in \S\ref{sec:evol}, we describe the evolution of the fully coupled system comprising the wind, wave field, and underwater currents illustrating the velocity and turbulence dissipation rate fields.
%
