		We will define the map $\phi:T_3\map X$ inductively. At $n^{\text{th}}$-step, we define $\phi_n:B(v_0,n)\map X$ such that $\phi_n|_{B(v_0,n-1)}=\phi_{n-1}$. % and $\phi_n$ is $KD$-qi embedding.

		Define $\phi_0(v_0)=x_0$. 

