\caption{Undeformed triangle with sides (solid arrows) defined by the vectors $\vec{L}_i$, $\vec{L}_j$, and $\vec{L}_m$. After the nodes $i$, $j$, and $m$ are are displaced by $\vec{u}_i$, $\vec{u}_j$, and $\vec{u}_m$, the deformed sides (dashed arrows) are defined by $\vec{l}_i$, $\vec{l}_j$, and $\vec{l}_m$.}
